1
00:00:27,280 --> 00:00:27,879
Father...

2
00:00:29,399 --> 00:00:30,000
Mother...

3
00:00:32,359 --> 00:00:33,840
Lian Ye has avenged me.

4
00:00:38,679 --> 00:00:39,200
Minmin,

5
00:00:41,320 --> 00:00:43,320
it's been hard on you all these years.

6
00:00:45,439 --> 00:00:46,759
Brother Jing'an and Sister Huizhen

7
00:00:47,119 --> 00:00:48,640
used their pens as weapons in Shanghai,

8
00:00:50,159 --> 00:00:51,200
publishing anti-Japanese articles

9
00:00:51,439 --> 00:00:52,280
to support the Organization,

10
00:00:54,159 --> 00:00:55,520
before being assassinated by Japanese agents.

11
00:00:57,600 --> 00:00:58,560
If not for that,

12
00:01:00,479 --> 00:01:01,600
you wouldn't have been left

13
00:01:03,039 --> 00:01:04,400
to face all these storms alone.

14
00:01:05,799 --> 00:01:07,760
My parents died for a noble cause,

15
00:01:09,400 --> 00:01:10,439
with no regrets.

16
00:01:13,239 --> 00:01:14,599
I have my own destiny.

17
00:01:16,480 --> 00:01:18,040
Becoming an operative for the Organization

18
00:01:18,040 --> 00:01:18,920
and joining the resistance—

19
00:01:19,480 --> 00:01:20,519
it all leads to the same goal.

20
00:01:21,280 --> 00:01:22,680
It's also my way of avenging them.

21
00:01:26,560 --> 00:01:28,000
Born into these turbulent times,

22
00:01:29,200 --> 00:01:30,760
where evil runs rampant,

23
00:01:33,200 --> 00:01:35,079
I, Chen Dieyi, may possess little talent,

24
00:01:36,079 --> 00:01:38,079
but I still want to do my part to change this world.

25
00:01:41,359 --> 00:01:42,400
Perhaps tomorrow

26
00:01:45,239 --> 00:01:47,079
will usher in a brand-new world.

27
00:02:15,319 --> 00:02:17,639
Bro, I heard a fire broke out at Minchun Pavilion.

28
00:02:18,319 --> 00:02:20,400
The madam and several prostitutes burned to death.

29
00:02:20,800 --> 00:02:21,520
That's not all.

30
00:02:21,800 --> 00:02:23,280
I heard President Sun of the Shipboard Guild

31
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:24,400
was threatening them to do dirty work.

32
00:02:24,560 --> 00:02:25,680
They refused and took their own lives.

33
00:02:26,479 --> 00:02:27,919
Women can rival any man.

34
00:02:29,319 --> 00:02:30,000
What a shame.

35
00:02:30,159 --> 00:02:30,840
It really is.

36
00:02:31,599 --> 00:02:32,520
They chose death over surrender.

37
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:05,240
Let's go.

38
00:03:15,639 --> 00:03:16,680
Looks like you're recovering well.

39
00:03:17,199 --> 00:03:17,840
It's all thanks to you

40
00:03:18,240 --> 00:03:19,280
for granting my wish.

41
00:03:21,719 --> 00:03:22,479
I want freedom.

42
00:03:23,199 --> 00:03:24,319
I want to be free like you.

43
00:03:25,319 --> 00:03:25,800
Alright.

44
00:03:27,319 --> 00:03:29,159
Back then, to get out of Minchun Pavilion,

45
00:03:30,199 --> 00:03:31,639
it took everything I had.

46
00:03:33,560 --> 00:03:34,719
With a single word from you,

47
00:03:35,439 --> 00:03:36,400
I wouldn't have made it out.

48
00:03:37,159 --> 00:03:39,520
Why were you willing to let me go?

49
00:03:41,439 --> 00:03:43,199
By using such drastic measures,

50
00:03:44,080 --> 00:03:45,840
you wanted to make one thing clear to everyone.

51
00:03:47,080 --> 00:03:47,919
If they wanted to keep you,

52
00:03:48,439 --> 00:03:49,360
either you died,

53
00:03:50,199 --> 00:03:51,120
or he died.

54
00:03:51,759 --> 00:03:53,319
But for Minchun Pavilion,

55
00:03:53,639 --> 00:03:55,199
whether it was your death or his,

56
00:03:55,919 --> 00:03:56,840
it meant trouble.

57
00:03:58,520 --> 00:04:00,719
And I was taking a gamble, too.

58
00:04:02,639 --> 00:04:03,319
Gambling on what?

59
00:04:03,800 --> 00:04:04,840
On an opportunity.

60
00:04:07,120 --> 00:04:09,840
Gambling that the path you risked your life to take

61
00:04:09,840 --> 00:04:12,520
would one day be a path I could walk, too.

62
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:16,800
Whenever I felt like I couldn't hold on,

63
00:04:17,399 --> 00:04:19,439
I would go look outside Hua Moli.

64
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:23,759
As long as you, Chen Dieyi, were still alive,

65
00:04:25,639 --> 00:04:26,519
I still had hope.

66
00:04:30,639 --> 00:04:32,399
The moment you showed up at Minchun Pavilion,

67
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:34,319
I knew my wait was over,

68
00:04:35,079 --> 00:04:35,839
and my gamble had paid off.

69
00:04:47,920 --> 00:04:49,040
You're not going to see him one last time?

70
00:04:51,199 --> 00:04:51,720
No.

71
00:04:52,600 --> 00:04:53,079
Why?

72
00:04:54,639 --> 00:04:56,199
The time I spent by his side...

73
00:04:56,480 --> 00:04:57,720
...felt like a dream.

74
00:04:58,319 --> 00:05:00,480
Back before I entered Minchun Pavilion,

75
00:05:00,800 --> 00:05:02,079
when I was still a girl from a decent family.

76
00:05:02,879 --> 00:05:04,079
But you have to wake up eventually.

77
00:05:04,879 --> 00:05:06,040
I already made a mistake once.

78
00:05:06,639 --> 00:05:07,680
I can't make another.

79
00:05:09,040 --> 00:05:11,120
Besides, freedom matters more.

80
00:05:18,160 --> 00:05:18,759
Inside,

81
00:05:19,120 --> 00:05:21,519
are the new Good Citizen Passes the police made for you.

82
00:05:23,079 --> 00:05:23,800
One for each of you.

83
00:05:24,800 --> 00:05:25,279
From now on,

84
00:05:26,519 --> 00:05:27,319
live your lives well.

85
00:05:28,680 --> 00:05:29,519
Everything from the past,

86
00:05:31,079 --> 00:05:32,000
let it vanish like smoke,

87
00:05:32,800 --> 00:05:33,399
and be wiped completely clean.

88
00:05:35,920 --> 00:05:36,360
Everyone,

89
00:05:38,199 --> 00:05:38,759
stay safe out there.

90
00:05:39,680 --> 00:05:40,959
Yan'an is freezing in winter,

91
00:05:41,439 --> 00:05:42,199
so for each of you,

92
00:05:42,199 --> 00:05:43,439
I've prepared a pair of fleece gloves.

93
00:05:44,800 --> 00:05:45,600
Take care on your journey.

94
00:05:46,600 --> 00:05:47,360
Safe travels.

95
00:05:55,959 --> 00:05:58,079
Thank you, Boss Chen, for the gift of a second life.

96
00:05:58,439 --> 00:06:01,079
May you have peace and joy year after year.

97
00:06:17,160 --> 00:06:17,720
Go on.

98
00:06:31,240 --> 00:06:33,040
Hurry up and board if you haven't yet!

99
00:06:33,279 --> 00:06:34,120
The boat's about to leave!

100
00:07:02,160 --> 00:07:03,399
Just to give one person a thank-you gift,

101
00:07:03,800 --> 00:07:04,680
you gave one to everyone.

102
00:07:05,800 --> 00:07:06,680
Why didn't you go in person?

103
00:07:09,879 --> 00:07:10,480
This is enough.

104
00:07:13,480 --> 00:07:14,560
It's all thanks to you guys this time.

105
00:07:15,160 --> 00:07:16,519
What do you want to eat? My treat.

106
00:07:17,800 --> 00:07:19,519
How about Old Rongcheng, then?

107
00:07:20,839 --> 00:07:21,480
How about Weizhongwei?

108
00:07:23,480 --> 00:07:25,439
All right, then let's go eat at

109
00:07:25,600 --> 00:07:26,199
Juchunyuan, then.

110
00:07:41,839 --> 00:07:42,360
Mingyuan.

111
00:07:42,680 --> 00:07:43,680
Up so early today?

112
00:07:45,160 --> 00:07:46,079
Something came up at the police station.

113
00:07:48,519 --> 00:07:49,000
Mingyuan.

114
00:07:49,680 --> 00:07:52,199
H-How is your injury?

115
00:07:53,680 --> 00:07:54,279
It's already healed.

116
00:07:56,120 --> 00:07:56,959
You silly kid...

117
00:07:57,480 --> 00:07:58,240
For something this big,

118
00:07:58,560 --> 00:07:59,639
if you'd just said something earlier,

119
00:08:00,079 --> 00:08:01,639
I wouldn't have hit you so hard.

120
00:08:02,360 --> 00:08:04,120
Fine, I'll definitely tell you next time.

121
00:08:05,759 --> 00:08:06,480
I'm off, then.

122
00:08:09,720 --> 00:08:10,759
Come home early after work!

123
00:08:12,079 --> 00:08:12,680
Got it.

124
00:08:15,319 --> 00:08:16,639
That's my boy.

125
00:08:28,680 --> 00:08:29,360
Good morning, Chief Li.

126
00:08:29,800 --> 00:08:30,360
Good morning.

127
00:08:32,320 --> 00:08:33,720
Chief Li, you have a letter.

128
00:08:36,679 --> 00:08:37,279
Keep up the good work.

129
00:08:37,759 --> 00:08:38,240
Yes, sir.

130
00:08:43,759 --> 00:08:44,240
Chief Li.

131
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:48,200
Is the police station still the same as before?

132
00:08:49,799 --> 00:08:50,320
Not anymore.

133
00:08:50,639 --> 00:08:51,279
Get back to work now.

134
00:08:51,720 --> 00:08:52,399
Yes, Chief.

135
00:09:19,919 --> 00:09:22,399
I heard Mr. Matsui is particularly fond of chess,

136
00:09:23,440 --> 00:09:26,639
so I came today specifically for a match.

137
00:09:59,279 --> 00:10:00,320
My younger brother, Lian Yu,

138
00:10:01,679 --> 00:10:04,440
has stayed at your residence for quite some time.

139
00:10:05,840 --> 00:10:08,879
I wonder if Mr. Matsui could be generous

140
00:10:10,399 --> 00:10:11,240
and let him come home.

141
00:10:14,159 --> 00:10:15,480
What you are saying, Hall Master Lian,

142
00:10:17,279 --> 00:10:18,080
makes no sense to me.

143
00:10:27,480 --> 00:10:28,159
Good move.

144
00:10:30,080 --> 00:10:31,679
You are young and capable, Hall Master Lian.

145
00:10:32,200 --> 00:10:33,960
It is a shame to remain just a Hall Master.

146
00:10:37,600 --> 00:10:39,360
The leadership of the Sanshan Gang...

147
00:10:39,679 --> 00:10:40,600
If that is what you desire,

148
00:10:41,879 --> 00:10:44,360
I could certainly lend you a hand.

149
00:10:51,840 --> 00:10:52,919
Don't trouble yourself.

150
00:10:53,919 --> 00:10:55,440
When hands reach too far,

151
00:10:56,440 --> 00:10:57,600
I usually chop them off.

152
00:11:02,440 --> 00:11:03,120
Farewell.

153
00:11:10,240 --> 00:11:11,120
If you don't want it,

154
00:11:13,039 --> 00:11:14,240
someone else will.

155
00:11:19,759 --> 00:11:21,399
Rest assured, Captain Xu.

156
00:11:22,399 --> 00:11:24,440
The guns, ammunition, and medicine...

157
00:11:24,559 --> 00:11:27,240
I'll definitely find a way to secure them for you.

158
00:11:28,480 --> 00:11:29,320
You are truly honorable, Mr. He.

159
00:11:29,720 --> 00:11:30,600
On behalf of the guerrillas,

160
00:11:30,960 --> 00:11:32,799
thank you for your aid and support.

161
00:11:34,639 --> 00:11:35,559
We're all Chinese.

162
00:11:36,240 --> 00:11:38,799
Standing together against Japan is only natural.

163
00:11:40,240 --> 00:11:41,320
My wife and I

164
00:11:41,320 --> 00:11:43,879
both hope this war ends soon.

165
00:11:45,519 --> 00:11:46,759
Rest assured, Mr. He.

166
00:11:47,480 --> 00:11:50,159
I always keep my promises.

167
00:11:52,879 --> 00:11:53,480
Farewell.

168
00:12:03,720 --> 00:12:04,919
Murder! Murder!

169
00:12:10,799 --> 00:12:11,840
Another year has passed.

170
00:12:12,480 --> 00:12:13,679
It's the New Year!

171
00:12:14,960 --> 00:12:16,320
It's the New Year! Slow down!

172
00:12:16,320 --> 00:12:17,360
It's the New Year! You're all grown up!

173
00:12:17,360 --> 00:12:18,039
Cook a few more dishes!

174
00:12:18,039 --> 00:12:19,440
Have you washed those vegetables yet?

175
00:12:19,440 --> 00:12:20,120
We're waiting on them!

176
00:12:20,480 --> 00:12:21,399
We're counting on you!

177
00:12:21,399 --> 00:12:22,159
Hurry up!

178
00:12:22,399 --> 00:12:23,000
You got it, Village Chief!

179
00:12:23,000 --> 00:12:24,000
How are the couplets coming along?

180
00:12:24,240 --> 00:12:25,399
Hurry up! - Almost done, almost done!

181
00:12:26,159 --> 00:12:27,200
How are those lanterns being hung?

182
00:12:28,600 --> 00:12:29,480
This is so wonderful.

183
00:12:30,320 --> 00:12:32,080
Old friend, long time no see!

184
00:12:32,759 --> 00:12:33,679
Welcome, welcome!

185
00:12:34,200 --> 00:12:34,559
Uncle Wan.

186
00:12:34,559 --> 00:12:35,799
Happy New Year! Happy New Year!

187
00:12:35,799 --> 00:12:37,399
Happy New Year! Happy New Year!

188
00:12:39,440 --> 00:12:40,320
It's a rare chance.

189
00:12:40,480 --> 00:12:41,360
Later, the two of us...

190
00:12:41,360 --> 00:12:42,440
...must have a good drink together!

191
00:12:42,440 --> 00:12:43,879
Definitely, we'll have a few rounds!

192
00:12:46,279 --> 00:12:47,159
What are you doing?

193
00:12:47,159 --> 00:12:48,000
Writing Spring Festival couplets.

194
00:12:48,399 --> 00:12:49,120
Brother Mingyuan.

195
00:12:49,159 --> 00:12:50,480
Guess who wrote this one.

196
00:12:51,480 --> 00:12:53,000
The calligraphy on this couplet is so delicate,

197
00:12:53,360 --> 00:12:54,799
the strokes steady and fluid,

198
00:12:55,240 --> 00:12:56,200
showing such skill.

199
00:12:56,320 --> 00:12:57,039
You definitely wrote it.

200
00:12:57,840 --> 00:12:59,080
Then guess who wrote this one?

201
00:13:01,159 --> 00:13:02,200
This counts as a couplet?

202
00:13:03,919 --> 00:13:05,360
Is it really that bad?

203
00:13:05,639 --> 00:13:07,039
I thought I wrote it pretty well!

204
00:13:08,159 --> 00:13:09,840
Did you forget everything your teacher taught you?

205
00:13:12,000 --> 00:13:13,000
Hey, I studied abroad!

206
00:13:13,240 --> 00:13:13,799
Right, right.

207
00:13:19,240 --> 00:13:20,600
Wanting, stop messing around.

208
00:13:20,679 --> 00:13:21,639
Come on, dinner's ready!

209
00:13:21,720 --> 00:13:22,200
Coming!

210
00:13:23,480 --> 00:13:24,720
For all of us to gather at one table

211
00:13:24,840 --> 00:13:26,120
for New Year's Eve dinner isn't easy.

212
00:13:26,440 --> 00:13:27,240
Come, let's raise a glass!

213
00:13:28,279 --> 00:13:28,960
To our reunion!

214
00:13:29,440 --> 00:13:30,440
To peace year after year!

215
00:13:30,440 --> 00:13:31,519
To prosperity every year!

216
00:13:31,720 --> 00:13:32,799
Eat and drink your fill. Great!

217
00:13:32,799 --> 00:13:33,639
To smooth sailing!

218
00:13:33,879 --> 00:13:34,879
To good fortune and great luck!

219
00:13:35,159 --> 00:13:37,879
Happy New Year!

220
00:13:45,799 --> 00:13:46,440
Hear, hear!

221
00:14:29,919 --> 00:14:31,679
Alright, I'm home.

222
00:14:32,559 --> 00:14:33,639
You should head back to the Sanshan Gang.

223
00:14:37,360 --> 00:14:38,279
I'll watch you go in.

224
00:15:01,279 --> 00:15:02,399
So clingy, aren't you?

225
00:15:03,159 --> 00:15:04,200
Is there anything else?

226
00:15:09,840 --> 00:15:11,039
Is there anything else?

227
00:15:14,120 --> 00:15:14,759
Captain Xu.

228
00:15:16,039 --> 00:15:16,679
Hurry, get up.

229
00:15:19,360 --> 00:15:19,960
Hold on.

230
00:15:22,519 --> 00:15:23,159
Let's go.
